==id $Id: unicode_lib.sfd 1.0 (23.10.2026) unicode.library, AmigaChrome Team $
* unicode.library: one shared copy of Unicode (ICU 78) for every program. MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 AmigaChrome Team.
* scripts/gen-unicodelib-sdk.sh makes sdk/ (clib, inline, pragmas, proto, FD, LVOs) from this with
* OpenNDK's ndkgen.py; unicode_lib.c's vector table follows it line for line.
==base _UnicodeBase
==basetype struct Library *
==libname unicode.library
==include <libraries/unicode.h>
==bias 30
==public
* ICU's C calls, in calls.txt's order (reads ICU's data the first time)
APTR UnicodeTable(ULONG count) (d0)
==end
